# Hallmark ([usehallmark.com](https://www.usehallmark.com))

Read `.cursor/skills/hallmark/SKILL.md` and follow it **only** when:

- The user names **Hallmark** or runs `/hallmark …`
- They ask to **build or design a new page/site** with strong visual direction
- They explicitly request **`/hallmark redesign <path>`** or **`/hallmark audit <path>`**

Do **not** apply Hallmark to polish an existing LoadShed UI unless the user asks for a Hallmark redesign.

Skill directory: `.agents/skills/hallmark/` (symlinked at `.cursor/skills/hallmark/`).

- Themes: read **one** file from `references/themes/` per build (via `scripts/theme.mjs` when available).
- Before handoff: `node .agents/skills/hallmark/scripts/sloplint.mjs <output> --render` when Node is available.

Coordinate with `ui-ux-skills-coordination.mdc`: project `DESIGN.md` and Impeccable context win for in-product UI; Hallmark is strongest for **new** marketing or standalone pages.
